Description: OpenMediaVault native file manager plugin
 A native file manager built entirely on the OpenMediaVault declarative
 workbench framework. Browse, search, preview, edit, upload, download,
 download from URLs, copy, move, compress and extract files within shared
 folders, with a trash, permission management and an audit log, without
 any external application.
